                        "form_id": "1252002b-9aee-45fb-8903-a2e5e0dd5c33",
                        "entry_id": "bd53b1c2-c4fd-3e99-8658-f600aefb441c",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "short-form"
                        ],
                        "form": "экстраордина́рны"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "908a16eb-1284-3a35-b93d-fa468bead1df",
                        "entry_id": "bd53b1c2-c4fd-3e99-8658-f600aefb441c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "книжн. выходящий из ряда обычных явлений, исключительный"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "60e12e68-4a13-4f9b-8cef-7bfe2444a5a3",
                                "sense_id": "908a16eb-1284-3a35-b93d-fa468bead1df",
                                "text": "Третьего дня я продал на четыре тысячи лесу, но это мера экстраординарная, которою нельзя пользоваться ежегодно."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "114b7d3a-4612-3fce-afdd-ef12d141291a",
                        "entry_id": "bd53b1c2-c4fd-3e99-8658-f600aefb441c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "спец. сверхштатный, не входящий в штат (учебного заведения и т. п.)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4eff0565-e9ac-47b3-84ec-42cf0e5b7193",
                                "sense_id": "114b7d3a-4612-3fce-afdd-ef12d141291a",
                                "text": "В 1839 Роберта Бунзена пригласили в Марбургский университет на должность экстраординарного профессора химии и директора химического института, через два года он стал ординарным профессором."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9d6cd962-2792-4e3a-9b5e-bddc645c3eb5",
                        "source_entry_id": "bd53b1c2-c4fd-3e99-8658-f600aefb441c",
                        "target_lang_word": "extraordinary",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "extraordinary",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "db0dfa86-7831-3744-b30e-0fbb136bd2d0",
                                        "entry_id": "9d74f97a-a370-3dee-b2c7-b04bece01430",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not ordinary; exceptional; unusual."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8de70641-82e3-4370-8aea-c8587e1ea848",
                                                "sense_id": "db0dfa86-7831-3744-b30e-0fbb136bd2d0",
                                                "text": "Except in extraordinary circumstances, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "77ea7651-5b03-4bef-99bb-3161bb33f1e6",
                                                "sense_id": "db0dfa86-7831-3744-b30e-0fbb136bd2d0",
                                                "text": "Everybody knew I was an extraordinary person. When I was born my beard was three feet long."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b17957c4-18c6-4c53-8d0f-c0e9cbab032c",
                                                "sense_id": "db0dfa86-7831-3744-b30e-0fbb136bd2d0",
                                                "text": "The Houses may meet in extraordinary sessions at the request of the Government, of the Permanent Deputation or of the overall majority of members of either of the two Houses. Extraordinary sessions must be convened with a specific agenda and shall be adjourned once this has been dealt with."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2f132cc3-517f-41c7-bce1-739f7badaa94",
                                                "sense_id": "db0dfa86-7831-3744-b30e-0fbb136bd2d0",
                                                "text": "Tony Woodcock's early try and a penalty from fourth-choice fly-half Stephen Donald were enough to see the All Blacks home in an extraordinary match that defied all pre-match predictions."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2cd2787c-91fc-4538-8c2b-944efeb90ac8",
                                                "sense_id": "db0dfa86-7831-3744-b30e-0fbb136bd2d0",
                                                "text": "From the ground, Colombo’s port does not look like much. […] But viewed from high up in one of the growing number of skyscrapers in Sri Lanka’s capital, it is clear that something extraordinary is happening: China is creating a shipping hub just 200 miles from India’s southern tip."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ebe60052-77bd-3bf0-be8d-9875eade65fc",
                                        "entry_id": "9d74f97a-a370-3dee-b2c7-b04bece01430",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Remarkably good."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0de7d07f-e2cd-4c30-afd1-f0091ee500cb",
                                                "sense_id": "ebe60052-77bd-3bf0-be8d-9875eade65fc",
                                                "text": "an extraordinary poet"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "50a46237-3aa8-397b-8762-5528fa9ec369",
                                        "entry_id": "9d74f97a-a370-3dee-b2c7-b04bece01430",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Special or supernumerary."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a08fdec-0883-4a0d-86cf-4d6c9b2f685c",
                                                "sense_id": "50a46237-3aa8-397b-8762-5528fa9ec369",
                                                "text": "the physician extraordinary in a royal household"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2c0da6e1-0ebb-4467-a347-4e85069f1d6a",
                                                "sense_id": "50a46237-3aa8-397b-8762-5528fa9ec369",
                                                "text": "an extraordinary professor in a German university"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "extraordinary",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "68715755-cdf5-3fa5-ad8d-4946a439c4f6",
                                        "entry_id": "d3610ff0-fc62-37c6-bfe4-e196955f6245",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Anything that goes beyond what is ordinary."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e6eeec07-dc92-4eba-9c3b-3fb3aa6b3209",
                                                "sense_id": "68715755-cdf5-3fa5-ad8d-4946a439c4f6",
                                                "text": "[…] the sum that will probably be wanted for each head of service during the year: it is divided into the ordinary, and the extraordinaries."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "62cc3f0d-133a-4682-beee-b399edfa45ff",
                        "source_entry_id": "bd53b1c2-c4fd-3e99-8658-f600aefb441c",
                        "target_lang_word": "straordinario",
                        "target_lang_code": "it",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "straordinario",
                                "target_lang_code": "it",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "97ff5088-f19a-3a50-a419-0f66ce3ae2fd",
                                        "entry_id": "f4119453-0823-32c2-9039-d78dfec05ef1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "più unico che usuale"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7bfee70a-6e9a-4500-b49d-aa694229f28b",
                                                "sense_id": "97ff5088-f19a-3a50-a419-0f66ce3ae2fd",
                                                "text": "il primo giubileo straordinario fu indetto da Urbano VI nel 1390, ma morì prima di dare il via alle celebrazioni"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "straordinario",
                                "target_lang_code": "it",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f1c861cd-571e-33a6-8c06-ac8833ca3d68",
                                        "entry_id": "f40cc5d6-551f-3210-a14b-83403e6c71a8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "lavoro al di fuori degli orari di lavoro normali (usato perlopiù al plurale, ad es.: fare gli straordinari), oppure il pagamento di tali lavori straordinari (riscuotere gli straordinari)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "diritto"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8cfb02f8-8fab-43ba-bd9f-5434b1ecfa43",
                                                "sense_id": "f1c861cd-571e-33a6-8c06-ac8833ca3d68",
                                                "text": "il datore di lavoro mi ha chiesto di fare lo straordinario"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
